L0518: Unsupported or incompatible shared trait object

Use `&dyn Trait` with ordinary shared-receiver methods and physical scalar/tuple signatures. Fix every associated type. Coercions need a shared borrow of a checked implementation with matching associated types. Bare, owned and mutable objects, logical members, proof contracts and imported object interfaces are not supported in this tier.

```rust reject L0518
trait Reading { fn read(&self) -> u8; }
fn consume(value: dyn Reading) {}
```

Language, as built: [1.31:55](../spec/20-traits.md#shared-trait-objects).
